---
const mailtoBody = encodeURIComponent(`Product URL:

Flow that breaks:

What users do instead:

What this costs you:

Who needs the review:

Evidence available:
`);
---

<section id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-tagline">Send me the flow that is already failing.</div>

    <h2 style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Send this brief.</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--gray); margin-bottom:2.5rem; font-size:0.95rem; max-width:620px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">
      Send the flow your team keeps explaining, compensating for, or routing around. I will tell you whether it fits a Hidden Scaffold Review.
    </p>

    <div class="brief-list" aria-label="Hidden Scaffold Review brief checklist">
      <div><span>Product URL</span></div>
      <div><span>Flow that breaks</span></div>
      <div><span>What users do instead</span></div>
      <div><span>What this costs you</span></div>
      <div><span>Who needs the review</span></div>
      <div><span>Evidence available</span></div>
    </div>

    <p class="section-copy contact-note">
      Do not send private customer data, credentials, or regulated data in the first email. Describe the pattern first.
    </p>
    <p class="section-copy contact-note">
      A Hidden Scaffold Review works only when there is evidence to inspect and an owner willing to act on the finding.
    </p>

    <div class="contact-links">
      <a href={`mailto:yassergandhi.dev@gmail.com?subject=Hidden%20Scaffold%20Review&body=${mailtoBody}`} class="contact-link btn-primary contact-cta">
        Request a Hidden Scaffold Review
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/yassergandhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-link">
        <span class="contact-link-label">LinkedIn</span>
        <span class="contact-link-value">/in/yassergandhi</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/yassergandhi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-link">
        <span class="contact-link-label">GitHub</span>
        <span class="contact-link-value">/yassergandhi</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://huhugerman.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-link">
        <span class="contact-link-label">Proof</span>
        <span class="contact-link-value">huhugerman.com</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="terminal-footer">
      Ciudad de México · Remote · Guidance Failure Architecture · TypeScript · Supabase · Zod · 2026
      <span class="cursor"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
